  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 61b4ef69776623b4f92b74bdf634fb1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  sceneName: TorchHouse
  spawnPointIndex: 0
  sceneVariant: 1
  skybox: {fileID: 0}
  cameraTarget: {fileID: 520141413}
--- !u!114 &399412744
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 399412741}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Your name is STRETCH. You have unnaturally flexible body parts. You have
      other attributes too, steadfast loyalty and the ability to crochet perfect
      replicas of your friends, to name two, but neither seemed important in naming
      you
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "And unbeknownst to your friends, you decided to break into the library
      because things aren\u2019t quite adding up\u2026"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "You walk into the library, now without its owner, and confidently sit
      at the front desk. With some grunting and moaning, you manage to regurgitate
      the key you\u2019ve been keeping safely in your stomach. Gee, that was more
      effort than it was worth.\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Blank
  - text: Inside the desk is a book - a registry of all the family weapons in town,
      and their lineage. You immediately scan the page to KHAN, and see.. Jade was
      right all along. You had the feeling the sword belonged to her, but now you
      see it in writing
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "Could this be the reason Storm didn\u2019t want anyone in the vault? Did
      she have any power of her own or was it all stolen from Jade?\r\n\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "This is bad news. If Jade can wield the sword to its fullest power, apocalypse
      or not, we can\u2019t let her get inside the vault"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Mad
  - text: "And you connected some different dots too\u2013 Just beneath Khan on the
      list, you see an instantly familiar face. It\u2019s a selfie of Torch holding
      his katana up like a prize fish"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "But it\u2019s no ordinary sword. The sword allows its wielder to perform
      one of the most mysterious moves in all of You-Jitsu. He\u2019s told you about
      the move, and how unpredictable it is"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: The better he knows a location, inside and out, the more he can focus,
      dematerializing his spirit and arriving instantly at that place. And according
      to this document, the sword can amplify that focus.
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "If he\u2019s ever been in the Vault\u2026 Crap, he helped us DESIGN the
      vault. He knows it perfectly!!\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: HE MUST BE IN SO MUCH DANGER RIGHT NOW!!! LIKE OMG! I NEED TO TELL STORM
      ABOUT THIS!!!
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 520141413}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
