--- !u!114 &1841830734
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1841830732}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "This is not how Ancient Sparta was at all \u2014 it\u2019s like they just
      slapped the name onto some sort of cult to pull in people like me"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: "They were right about one thing- We can\u2019t trust a soul"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 583000417}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "Did they mention the part about the true Spartan performing a SOUL RELEASE
      with the blade? It\u2019s supposed to be cataclysmic"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 974648309}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: "That\u2019s the one part of the prophecy that might hold water - and it\u2019s
      why we have to keep it locked down. But really we have nothing to fear."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1033884060}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: Sensei and I are the owners of that blade, we are the only ones who could
      perform that soul release... Plus, the vault is... Hazardous...
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1033884060}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: "So you\u2019re saying.. Chrome dome attacked y\u2019all because he wanted
      to be the one the prophecy told about?"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 38160111}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: "Or maybe he was going to give it to me. The timing seemed awfully suspicious,
      with him acting up the moment I arrived in town\u2026"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: " I knew I should\u2019ve signed up at the Spartan school!"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Angry
  - text: SHHHH!!!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 7095386176128879872}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Angry
  - text: "Jack, that is NOT the conclusion I got from that. I know you hate these
      girls but they\u2019re probably right- the sword is strong and you\u2019re
      thinking with your ape brain. Ooh ooh shiny sword! Me want sword!"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 665988658}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Angry
  - text: 'Pssht, better than these PSYCHOS having it!

      At least I want it
      for something NOBLE'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: OPENING A PORTAL TO BRING YOUR DAD BACK ISN'T NOBLE, IT'S SELFISH! BECAUSE
      IT'S GONNA GET US ALL KILLED!
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1033884060}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: ENOUGH ALREADY!
    name: Librarian
    character: {fileID: 7095386176128879872}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
