--- !u!114 &1841830736
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1841830732}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c530a24ea0ef8d34990d94afbefe7c3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - EVER SINCE ANCIENT TIMES, the Spartans have believed in Strength above all else
    - in a world that has gone weak, a modern day Spartan carries with them the ancient
    beliefs.
  - Spartans carry no attachments, except to their country and their family. The
    world has tried to suppress the Spartan nation through trickery and fear - fear
    for our strength - but we are alive and we are hiding.
  - 'Lying in wait for the true Spartan to usher in a new era where the only thing
    that matters is strength. The cowardly, double crossing ninjas will come to light,
    and the spirits will empower us to take back our world! '
  - Every Spartan owns an untraceable communication unit, and the true allies of
    the true Spartan will hear the calling. If you are deemed worthy, you must blindly
    obey.
  - You must use your Strength to move the prophecy forward. You must trust no one
    but the call, as you cannot trust anyone - especially those closest to you. Ninjas
    surround us.
  - Anyone could be one. They prey upon your weakness and corrupt your mind. Stay
    strong, and you will be welcomed in the end times!
--- !u!114 &1841830737
