'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: 'That''s right...

      And Chrome Dome tried to break into the dojo girls''
      vault and steal the sword... for you!

'
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 38160111}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: 'But...

      I don''t wanna cause the end of the world'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Exactly, so are you gonna stop trying to steal it from us? '
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 974648309}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Mad
  - text: I dunno, I say the sword is better off in your hands than anyone else's,
      Mister True Spartan. You've seen how much our enemies are willing to do. We
      need the firepower
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 38160111}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: You're playing with fire, both of you. Even if you don't cause some sort
      of crazy apocalypse, you saw the computer records... that vault is RADIOACTIVE
      and it's getting worse with every passing day!
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1033884060}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Surprised
  - text: 'This is getting ugly...

      If I ever get my hands on Khan, i''m blowing
      that thing to bits, even if it kills me'
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 38160111}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Blow... it up???

      I never thought I''d hear you say those words
      - as a matter of fact, I have some homemade explosives that can help!'
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 665988658}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: (The thought of blowing something up fills you with a sense of awesomness...
      but...)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Happy
  - text: Well, this has certainly cleared nothing up. All it did was draw a few
      lines in the sand... I say we call it a day. And on the night of the solstice,
      if this means we fight, then we fight.
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Angry
  - text: 'Finally some common sense around here!

      (Thad raises his fist)

      Tomorrow
      we settle this THAD STYLE'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 401832728}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
